    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63501" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπερν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆτος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poor, forlorn,
			outcast</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ λιπερνῆτες πολῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					50
				</span></i>
			 (borrowed by <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				198
			</span></i>); context doubtful in <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				11.161
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Lagina</span>); =
			<i>pupillus</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρφανός</span>,
				<u>Gloss.</u>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπερν-ήτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.649
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				566.50
			</span></i>, restored by Schäfer in <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				2.22
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπεργάτης</span>:—fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐπερν-ῆτις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				66e
			</span></i>, Epic.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				1794.17
			</span></i>.</div>
